'''UNO MILLE''' was an organization-less [[:Category:Brazil|Brazilian]] ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' team and a former ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' team that originally formed in February 2022.

==Timeline==
{{tabs dynamic
|name1=2022
|name2=2023
|name3=2025
|name4=2026
|This=4
|content1=
* June 28th - '''UNO MILLE''' are signed by [[ODDIK]]. <ref name="oddik">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ODDIK_gg/status/1541813826412285955|title=CHEGAMOS GUYS, FELLAS, MÊOS!|trans_title=WE ARRIVE GUYS, FELLAS, MÊOS!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2022-06-28|author=[[ODDIK]]}}</ref>

|content2=
* July 20th - '''UNO MILLE''' is reformed with a roster consisting of [[RICIOLI]], [[rem1x]], [[realz1n]], [[danoco]], and [[ALLE]]. <ref name="roster 2023">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.com.br/noticias/38161/uno-mille-retorna-com-novalineup|title=UNO MILLE retorna com nova lineup|trans_title=UNO MILLE returns with a new lineup|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2023-07-20|publisher=[[Dust2.com.br]]|author=[[vhporto]]}}</ref>
* July 25th - '''UNO MILLE''' add [[sky (Brazilian player)|sky]] as coach. <ref name="roster 2023"/>
* October 20th - '''UNO MILLE''' are signed by [[Flamengo Esports]]. <ref name="flamengo">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/flaesports/status/1715512535640678838|title=Agora a Uno Mille é Flamengo Esports!|trans_title=Now Uno Mille is Flamengo Esports!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2023-10-20|author=[[Flamengo Esports]]}}</ref>

|content3=
* January 21st - '''UNO MILLE'''  is reformed with a roster consisting of [[rem1x]], [[realz1n]], [[zmb]], [[cerolzin]], [[bnc]], [[Xamp]], and [[r4ul]], the latter two as coach and his assistant. <ref name="roster 2025">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/victorem1x/status/1881873099702022292|title=GGwp 2-0 nas duas md1 de hoje vs @REDCanids pela ESL|trans_title=GGwp 2-0 in both best-of-one matches today against @REDCanids at ESL|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2025-01-21|author=[[rem1x]]}}</ref>
* January 30th - [[cerolzin]] steps down from '''UNO MILLE'''. <ref name="-cerolzin">{{inside source|date=2025-01-30|source=cerolzin}}</ref>
* February 10th - '''UNO MILLE''' add [[Leomonster]]. <ref name="+leomonster">{{inside source|date=2025-02-10|source=rem1x}}</ref>
* March 14th - '''UNO MILLE''' part ways with [[rem1x]], [[bnc]] and [[Xamp]] and add [[happ]], [[bsd]], and [[disturbed (Brazilian player)|disturbed]], the latter as coach. <ref name="change 2025">{{inside source|date=2025-01-30|source=zmb}}</ref><ref name="-rem1x">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/victorem1x/status/1900638933525897387|title=F/A|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2025-03-14|author=[[rem1x]]}}</ref><ref name="-xamp">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/xampCS/status/1900623146811642131|title=FREE AGENT|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2025-03-14|author=[[Xamp]]}}</ref>
* April 18th - '''UNO MILLE''' are signed by [[Nitro.GG]]. <ref name="nitro.gg">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/feelthenitro/status/1913373041016349179|title=UMA NOVA LINE ELETRIZANTE NO CS2|trans_title=A thrilling new line-up on CS2|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2025-04-18|author=[[Nitro.GG]]}}</ref>

|content4=
* March 8th - '''UNO MILLE''' is reformed by the former [[Four Magic]] roster, with the team consisting of: [[brokeN]], [[ltz]], [[cLd]], [[rem1x]], [[CloN7]], and [[KinGui]], the latter as the team's coach. <ref name="four magic">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/KinGui_91/status/2030764730701246683|title=Capitão mandou o papo sobre nossos últimos resultados, muito feliz com a constância apresentada pela equipe nesses últimos jogos|trans_title=The captain spoke about our recent results, very happy with the consistency shown by the team in these last few games|language={{flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2026-03-08|author=[[KinGui]]}}</ref>
* April 28th - [[CloN7]] steps down from '''UNO MILLE'''. <ref name="-clon7">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/CloN7cs/status/2048623735737819396|title=Salve rapaziada, depois de um bom tempo com a galera da UNO MILLE acabei saindo, venho anunciar que estou F/A e livre de qualquer contrato|trans_title=Hey guys, after a long time with the UNO MILLE crew, I've left. I'm announcing that I'm a free agent and free of any contract|language={{flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2026-04-28|author=[[CloN7]]}}</ref>
* May 12th - [[brokeN]] steps down from '''UNO MILLE'''. <ref name="-broken">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/brokencsgo_/status/2054308356257452362|title=Salve rapaziada, depois de um bom tempo com a UnoMille/TDK, acabei saindo e venho anunciar que estou F/A, livre no mercado|trans_title=Hey guys, after a long time with UnoMille/TDK, I ended up leaving and I'm announcing that I'm a free agent (F/A), available on the market|language={{flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2026-05-12|author=[[brokeN]]}}</ref>
*May 25th - [[ltz]] is signed by [[Fluxo W7M]]. <ref name="-ltz">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/fluxogg/status/2058941271968772132|title=O @dav1deuS_ e o @ltz_cs já estão prontos para representar|trans_title=@dav1deuS_ and @ltz_cs are ready to represent|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2026-05-25|author=[[Fluxo W7M]]}}</ref>
*August 24th - [[cLd]] steps down from '''UNO MILLE'''. <ref name="-cLd">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/cLLLdfps/status/2091907423858499952|title=Salve família, pós um longo tempo com a rapaziada da Tropa do Kingui/Uno mille estou F/A|trans_title=What's up, everyone? After a long time with the Tropa do Kingui/Uno Mille crew, I'm a free agent|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2026-08-24|author=[[cLd]]}}</ref>
*September 15th - [[pancc]] is signed by [[Yawara E-Sports]]. <ref name="yawara +pancc">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/yawaragg/status/2099860794611798474|title=Novo save iniciado|trans_title=New save started|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2026-09-15|author=[[Yawara E-Sports]]}}</ref>
*September 22nd - [[drg]] and [[KinGui]] are signed by [[Keyd Stars]]. <ref name="drg keyd stars">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/VivoKeyd/status/2102427710199115934|title=UPDATE COMPETITIVO NO TIME DE CS2|trans_title=COMPETITIVE UPDATE IN THE CS2 TEAM|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2026-09-22|author=[[Keyd Stars]]}}</ref>
}}

