'''UNiTY esports''' is a [[:Category:Slovakia|Slovak]] professional esports organization founded with the merger of [[Dark Tigers]] and [[DGG Esports]].

==Timeline==
{{tabs dynamic
|name1=2023
|name2=2024
|name3=2025
|name4=2026
|This=4

|content1=
*January 26th - '''UNiTY esports''' is founded with the merger of [[Dark Tigers]]'s ''[[CS:GO]]'' section and [[DGG Esports]] and the roster of the former moves under the new brand. <ref name="DTG">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/DarkTigersGG/posts/pfbid022oc371eLrTm3i4pZo5o1F2DqGXJbi9B61GgZZbVbAYrRXFHoZDqarM3kxcQy2znUl|title=Radi by sme Vám touto cestou oznámili že CS:GO sekcia Dark Tigers v novom ročníku 2023 bude vystupovať pod novou značkou UNiTY v ktorej sme sa spojili s DGG Esports|language={{Flag|sk}} Slovak|trans_title=We would like to announce that our Dark Tigers CS:GO section will compete in the year 2023 under the new brand UNiTY in which we have teamed up with DGG Esports|date=2023-01-26|author=[[Dark Tigers]]}}</ref>
*February 24th - '''UNiTY esports''' acquire [[luko]] from [[eSuba]] to finalize their roster. <ref name="+luko">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/_Team_UNiTY/status/1629092735041904641|title=Až dnes môžeme oficiálne potvrdiť "LUKA" ako nášho piateho csgo hráča|language={{Flag|sk}} Slovak|trans_title=Only today can we officially confirm "LUKO" as our fifth csgo player|date=2023-02-24|author='''UNiTY esports'''}}</ref>
*March 1st - '''UNiTY esports''' sign [[d0di]] as coach. <ref name="+d0di">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/_Team_UNiTY/status/1630960349733167104|title=CS:GO team without a coach?|date=2023-03-01|author='''UNiTY esports'''}}</ref>
*March 10th - '''UNiTY esports''' bench [[WEAMO]] and release [[creZe]] and [[HenkkyG]]. <ref name="-cHW">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/_Team_UNiTY/status/1634267217314435094|title=Our CS:GO team will play tomorrows Tipsport CS:GO Praha qualification in the changed roster|date=2023-03-22|author='''UNiTY esports'''}}</ref>
*March 31st - '''UNiTY esports''' part ways with [[WEAMO]]. <ref name="-WEAMO">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/_Team_UNiTY/status/1641825372982464512|title=It's time!|date=2023-03-31|author='''UNiTY esports'''}}</ref>
