|content1=
*September 24th - [[Virtus.pro]] announce the creation of '''VP.Prodigy''', an academy team consisting of [[mefixs]], [[muR]], [[awesome]], [[h1glaiN]], [[Norwi]], and [[Flash_1]] as coach. <ref name="CS">{{cite web|url=https://virtus.pro/en/articles/virtus-pro-launches-a-second-cs-go-roster|title=Virtus.pro launches a second CS:GO roster|date=2020-09-24|publisher=[[Virtus.pro]]}}</ref>

|content2=
*January 11th - '''VP.Prodigy''' part ways with [[mefixs]] and announce [[Re1GN]] as a stand-in. <ref name="-mefixs">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/virtuspro/status/1348653640186290178|title=mefixs is leaving VP.Prodigy!|date=2021-01-11|publisher=[[Virtus.pro]]}}</ref>
*January 29th - '''VP.Prodigy''' release the roster with the exception of [[Flash_1]]. <ref name="release">{{cite web|url=https://virtus.pro/en/articles/vp-prodigy-cs-go-roster-relaunch|title=VP.Prodigy CS:GO roster relaunch|date=2021-01-11|publisher=[[Virtus.pro]]}}</ref>
*March 17th - '''VP.Prodigy''' sign a new roster consisting of [[BloodyK]], [[r3salt]], [[cheerful]], [[RuFire]] and [[lom1k]]. <ref name="2021 roster">{{cite web|url=https://virtus.pro/en/articles/new-vp-prodigy-cs-go-roster|title=New VP.Prodigy CS:GO roster|date=2021-03-17|publisher=[[Virtus.pro]]}}</ref>
*September 14th - '''VP.Prodigy''' part ways with [[BloodyK]]. <ref name="-BloodyK">{{cite web|url=https://virtus.pro/en/articles/bloodyk-pokinet-vpprodigy|title=BloodyK will leave VP.Prodigy|date=2021-09-14|publisher=[[Virtus.pro]]}}</ref>
*September 22nd - '''VP.Prodigy''' sign [[Xerison]]. <ref name="+Xersion">{{cite web|url=https://virtus.pro/en/articles/novyi-igrok-vpprodigy-po-csgo|title=New VP.Prodigy player in CS:GO|date=2021-09-22|publisher=[[Virtus.pro]]}}</ref>
*December 13th - '''VP.Prodigy''' sign [[delus1onn]]. <ref name="+delus1onn">{{cite web|url=https://virtus.pro/en/articles/novyi-igrok-vpprodigy-po-csgo-1|title=New VP.Prodigy player in CS:GO|date=2021-12-13|publisher=[[Virtus.pro]]}}</ref>

|content3=
*January 29th - '''VP.Prodigy''' bench [[RuFire]]. <ref name="rufire benched">{{cite web|url=https://virtus.pro/en/articles/izmeneniya-v-sostave-vpprodigy-po-csgo|title=Changes in VP.Prodigy CS:GO roster|date=2022-01-29|publisher=[[Virtus.pro]]}}</ref>
*March 14th - '''VP.Prodigy''' release [[RuFire]]. <ref name="-rufire">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-153954974_16010|title=Резко неожиданный поворот и я свободный агент|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=A sudden turn and I'm a free agent|date=2022-03-14|author=[[RuFire]]}}</ref>
