*November 30th - '''VP.Prodigy''' part ways with [[cheerful]]. <ref name="-cheerful">{{cite web|url=https://virtus.pro/en/articles/cheerful-pokidaet-vpprodigy|title=cheerful is leaving VP.Prodigy|date=2022-11-30|publisher=[[Virtus.pro]]}}</ref>
