*May 12th - '''VP.Prodigy''' acquire [[44]] from [[Team QUAZAR]] as their new coach. <ref name="+44">{{cite web|url=https://virtus.pro/en/articles/vpprodigy-predstavlyaet-novogo-trenera-po-csgo|title=VP.Prodigy introduces a new CS:GO coach|date=2023-05-12|publisher=[[Virtus.pro]]}}</ref>
